# SQLite databases
#
# Matched repo-wide, not just under the root `db/`. Per-app databases live in `src/apps/{app-id}/db/`,
# so a bare `db/*.db` pattern never caught them and 29 app database sets were committed by accident.
# Runtime database files are local state: they change on every app launch, churn the working tree, and
# conflict on every merge. Schema and seeds belong in source (`*-schema.ts`, `seed-*.ts`), never in the
# `.db` file.
*.db
# WAL siblings: `*.db` does not match `x.db-shm` / `x.db-wal`, so these were tracked as separate files.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
# Per-worker Jest databases (see src/tests/jest.sqlite.setup.ts)
db/jest/

